# Quality audit artifact — kept local
quality.md

# Local agent/editor state — never part of the public tree.
# .claude/ and .cursor/ had a MEMORY.md, a session tracker and editor rules
# committed; Backend/.idea/ was a whole IntelliJ project.
.claude/
.cursor/
.opencode/

# Runtime artefacts that were committed once and shipped publicly:
# Backend/logs/*.log carried stack traces and a developer's home path,
# Backend/uploads/ a raw upload blob, Backend/temp_content/ a generated
# content dump. `*.log` above never covered files that were force-added.
logs/
uploads/
temp_content/
